{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/260109-compact-veneraters-of-old-gods-cultists-of-monsters","id":260109,"title":"[Compact] Veneraters of Old Gods - cultists of monsters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-18T15:03:13-07:00","id":260109,"title":"[Compact] Veneraters of Old Gods - cultists of monsters","content":"So I looked on my old notes, and found this idea on Hunters Compact I was long ago had. Write what you think about them and maybe propose their Endowments, yes? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><b>Veneraters of Old Gods</b></span></span><br /> The Worshipers<br /> <br /> Long, long time ago people were giving tributes and prayers to things older than themselves. And those beings answered they calls. They named them \u201egods\u201d and give their blessings to they worshipers. Crops were many, animals almost self gone in to their traps, weather was good and favorable. All the human need to do was to give a sacrifice and praises to being commanding elements or they fate. And in old times, those beings answered. They were guardians and keepers of humans. But times have changed, altars and idols were destroyed, people send they prayers to God, not gods, old ways were forgotten.<br /> <br /> Mostly. In remote regions were light of Church and scientific mind didn't get, old ways survived. They thrilled on respecting the tradition and gods themselves. But with enough time, even immortals can die. And so, once in a while, village need to find new guardian for them, new keeper. And so they needed to send they best hunters and trappers to look for them. These were only isolated incidents, one on the million. Until the worshipers returned to they old ways.<br /> <br /> On end of nineteenth century, the old return to modern world. With romantic movement and human passion to discover the past, folklore returned to civilization, even if only academic topic to talk in gentelmen's club. Exploration of distant lands and contacts with autohtonic people brought knowledge of old ways and weird rites to ensure prosperity or power. And so, in the dark corners of Western world, in basements of rich and vain, cults of Old Gods flourished. They had all they needed to work with \u2013 money, contacts, people. What they were missing were gods themselves.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:13px\">And so dangerous expedition were to made to catch a \u201cFairy Queens\u201d or \u201cImmortal Kings\u201d, that could lend the power to those that appease them. They returned with success, and discovered new gods to live in shadows of humanity. With rites founded in old legends and manuscripts, worshipers could bound they lords and keepers, and bring back fortune to they life. Most of the time they done this on their terms. But once in a while some groups were to much pleasing the god they keep and become the cult of it. The ill fate of cultist to the thing they should only used they bring back on themselves.</span><br /> <br /> And so they thrive to this day. Venerates are coalition of groups that masquerading as folklore societies or neopagan covens use the power of gods they capture. Sometimes the cell becomes the cult of being they should only use. Then rest of Hunters take care of them. But to that day, worshipers are mighty with power of thing they bound and control.<br /> <br /> <b>The Gods</b><br /> <br /> The worshipers treat monsters, especially Fea, as old beings that help mankind with they supernatural powers. Dangerous and whimsical, but in some way benevolent. If bounded and please, they are more blessing than a curse to humanity. At least to the time, when human capturing it don't really starting to worship them. When used in proper conditions blood of one vampire can heal whole village, witches spells can help whole community and Fae Lord can become real guardian of people. Only you must make right rites to bound it. And found it in the first place.<br /> <br /> They are Hunter Compact only because they must \u201chunt\u201d they new gods and then use them, instead of worshiping. Of course they use old incantations and prayers, but any monster that heard about them know it's only pose and those humans want to dry him to the last drop of blood in the long way. The problem to they victims is they don't say a monster they are Venerates \u2013 they play by it's rules and introduce themselves as classical cult. Most of the time egomaniac begins old as civilization just assume pathetic humans wouldn't dare to stretch the line to far and know they place beneath the Old Gods. And this hubris is making they own prison. In the end, monsters are working for the Vigil of hunters themselves.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:13px\">There is also a second side of this medal. Thin line between using the monsters and worshiping them is easily to cross. All it needs is that high priest become mind controlled by captured god or </span>that beings power is becoming truly godly in eyes of new members of congregation. Even if there are hunters loyal to idea of subduing the gods, from time to time they need to take care of they own brothers in coven. And if situation is really bad, other Hunters must resolve the problem Venerates created. And only new supplies of vampire's blood, Fae magic or just knowledge of monsters stop them before destroying worshipers group on sight.<br /> <br /> <b>Hunters</b><br /> <br /> You were raised in remote village in the country. Even if all other world is monotheistic or atheistic, your family was cultivating old ways for generations. Some time ago your guardian has left your community. You were chosen to find new one. And you are sure you will bring back one.<br /> <br /> You always thought that there is more to the life than media showed you. Deep inside you knew the myths of the past were true and Old Gods were somehow real. Your life studies in folklore only assured you. When you crossed your way with one of monsters, you know what to do. And other hunters thanked you.<br /> <br /> To your coven come new member. He told you he is vampire and you should venerate him. Many in the group just started to do what he want's, but you are smarter than that. If he is using you, you use him. You play his game. Until the group get's more than need to do. And when the times will come, you become the new high priest and found new god to worship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-27-2014, 06:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}